From: steamac <steamac@fxgam.es>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Extend the projected sample-rate interpolation workaround to M2

STEAMAC-CA (1.9.15, Apple M2 Max Mac14,6, macOS 27.2.1, 2 events): render
pipeline compile failed (Error code 2): "Undefined symbols:
llvm.agx2.sample.itrproj.1xf, referenced from: main0". That is the M1
failure of STEAMAC-8J, which 0051/0053 avoid with pull-model interpolation
at get_sample_position(gl_SampleID), but only on Apple7 without Apple8. The
captured four-sample pair (float3 v1 [[sample_perspective]] with projected
sampling) reproduces the undefined symbol on an M1 Max and links with the
workaround enabled; the reporting M2 Max is Apple8.

Enable the workaround on Apple7 and Apple8 GPUs (M1, M2), not Apple9 and
later, for which no failure was reported. Interpolation positions and
arithmetic are preserved, as on M1; the option is serialized as before.

Verified on M1 only (no M2 here): sentry-8j-projected.sh still passes.

Generated-by: LLM
---
diff --git a/MoltenVK/MoltenVK/GPUObjects/MVKPipeline.mm b/MoltenVK/MoltenVK/GPUObjects/MVKPipeline.mm
--- a/MoltenVK/MoltenVK/GPUObjects/MVKPipeline.mm
+++ b/MoltenVK/MoltenVK/GPUObjects/MVKPipeline.mm
@@ -2347,11 +2347,12 @@
 		if (mtlFeats.needsSampleDrefLodArrayWorkaround) {
 			shaderConfig.options.mslOptions.sample_dref_lod_array_as_grad = true;
 		}
-		// AGXMetalG13X (M1) cannot link projected sampling of sample-rate varyings.
+		// AGXMetalG13X (M1) and AGXMetalG14X (M2, STEAMAC-CA on an M2 Max) cannot link projected
+		// sampling of sample-rate varyings (undefined llvm.agx2.sample.itrproj.1xf).
 		// Preserve interpolation/arithmetic, but avoid the broken itrproj fusion.
 		const auto& gpuCaps = getPhysicalDevice()->getMTLDeviceCapabilities();
 		shaderConfig.options.mslOptions.sample_rate_interpolation_as_offset =
-			gpuCaps.supportsApple7 && !gpuCaps.supportsApple8 && mtlFeats.mslVersion >= 20300;
+			gpuCaps.supportsApple7 && !gpuCaps.supportsApple9 && mtlFeats.mslVersion >= 20300;
 		shaderConfig.options.mslOptions.for_mesh_pipeline = false;
 		if (_isRasterizing && pCreateInfo->pMultisampleState) {		// Must ignore allowed bad pMultisampleState pointer if rasterization disabled
 #if MVK_USE_METAL_PRIVATE_API
